# Metadati di citazione letti da GitHub ("Cite this repository").
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Swan-Ganz Thermodilution and Extravascular Pressure Transducer (RLC) Interactive Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based teaching simulator for pulmonary artery (Swan-Ganz)
  catheterisation, indicator thermodilution (Stewart-Hamilton), mixed venous
  oximetry and the Fick principle, and the dynamics of extravascular pressure
  transducers modelled as a second-order RLC hydraulic-electrical analogue.
  Interdisciplinary: biomedical engineering, medicine and critical care nursing.
  Five languages (IT, EN, FR, DE, ES). Educational use only; not a medical device.
